      'Expect “verified” to be used for “has a VER” in audit reports. Ask for the counting rule each time; credit reports that separate coverage (links) from status (verdicts).',
      'Expect verification cases whose subject is not the requirement’s satisfier, or whose subject definition differs from the requirement’s. The checker accepts both silently; the planner raises a ? when the subject names none of the requirement’s satisfiers. Ask which definition the requirement’s subject has.',
